\label{global.thm}
Let $c\in(0,c_*)$ and $p=1+\frac{4}{N}$.
If $u_0\in H^1(\mathbb{R}^N)$ satisfies
\begin{equation}\label{sharp}
\Vert u_0\Vert_{L^2}<M_\mathrm{gs},
\end {equation}
then the corresponding solution of \eqref{inls} given by Theorem~\ref{local.thm} is global.

