= (8-4N)\int |\nabla u|^2, 
\end{align}
where $\delta_{j,k}=1$ for $j=k$ and $0$ otherwise.


Since $\nabla(|u|^{p+1})=(p+1)|u|^{p-1}\re(u\nabla\bar{u})$, we obtain by integration by parts
